Subject: [PATCH] Leaf: Initialize line of sight cache with low capacity

A part of Leaf(https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf/blob/dev/1.21.9/leaf-server/minecraft-patches/features/0086-Initialize-line-of-sight-cache-with-low-capacity.patch)

